      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets a global value and returns success status.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store the input value to global variable g_dwStoredValue at address 0x6fbdc01c\n2. Return success indicator (1)\n\nParameters:\ndwValue (uint): The 32-bit value to store in the global variable\n\nReturns:\nint: Always returns 1 indicating successful storage\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Function always succeeds and returns 1\n- No validation performed on input value\n- Global storage location: g_dwStoredValue (0x6fbdc01c)\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1 (1): Success return value indicating operation completed",
