      "signature": "void SelectionSort(byte * pbLo, byte * pbHi, int nElemSize, void * pfnCompare)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Selection sort for small arrays (\u22648 elements).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Find maximum element in unsorted range [pbLo, pbHi]\n2. Swap maximum with last element (pbHi)\n3. Shrink range by nElemSize and repeat until sorted\n\nParameters:\n- pbLo (byte*): Pointer to first element\n- pbHi (byte*): Pointer to last element\n- nElemSize (int): Size in bytes of each element\n- pfnCompare (void*): Comparison function (returns >0 if first > second)\n\nReturns:\n- void",
