      "signature": "void SwapMemoryBytes(byte * pbSrc, byte * pbDst, int nByteCount)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Swaps bytes between two memory regions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pointers are different and count is non-zero\n2. Loop through each byte position:\n   - Save source byte to temp\n   - Copy destination byte to source\n   - Copy temp to destination\n   - Advance both pointers\n\nParameters:\n- pbSrc (byte*): First memory region\n- pbDst (byte*): Second memory region  \n- nByteCount (int): Number of bytes to swap\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- QuickSortIterative: Uses this to swap array elements",
