      "signature": "int SetStreamPropertyHandle(uint dwFd, HANDLE hOsHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Associates a Windows HANDLE with a CRT file descriptor.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate fd < g_dwMaxFileHandles\n2. Calculate table index (fd >> 5) and offset ((fd & 0x1f) * 0x24)\n3. Verify slot is free (handle == -1)\n4. For stdin/stdout/stderr (0/1/2), update Windows std handles\n5. Store hOsHandle in file handle table\n\nParameters:\n- dwFd (uint): CRT file descriptor (0=stdin, 1=stdout, 2=stderr)\n- hOsHandle (HANDLE): Windows OS handle to associate\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 on failure (errno set to EBADF=9)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): File handle table entry stride\n- 0x1f (31): Mask for intra-table index\n- 0xfffffff6 (-10): STD_INPUT_HANDLE\n- 0xfffffff5 (-11): STD_OUTPUT_HANDLE\n- 0xfffffff4 (-12): STD_ERROR_HANDLE\n- 9: EBADF (Bad file descriptor)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.08",
